notes.content:
New languages are now available in the game:
- Chinese simplified;
- Japanese;
- Korean;
- Turkish;
- Brazilian Portuguese;
- Spanish;
- Italian.

[h1]Hi everyone, we continue to improve our game, in the current update we have:[/h1]

[list]
[*] Added French language support;
[*] Added highlighting of destructible objects;
[*] Fixed bugs in localization in other languages;
[*] Redesigned shard drop balance;
[*] Reworked the placement of mobs in locations and arenas;
[*] Fixed character skins made from monster body parts from later levels;
[*] Fixed the work of the "Swarm" ability;
[*] Fixed button placement in the HUD;
[*] Fixed the operation of the "Acid Puddle" traps.
[/list]

If your saves stopped working due to updates, we can restore them if you contact us at [b]support@rubedogames.com.[/b]

[h2]Subscribe to our social networks: [/h2]
[list]
[*] [url=https://www.instagram.com/rubedo_games/ ]Instagram[/url]
[*] [url=https://twitter.com/SoulbindRubedo]Twitter[/url]
[*] [url=https://www.youtube.com/@rubedogames/ ]YouTube[/url]
[/list]

Prepared the following changes for the new update based on feedback received:
[list]
[*] improved visualization of dealing and receiving damage;
[*] fixed jump freezing;
[*] fixed hitbox of Samnymmat (Spearman);
[*] reduced the time of body parts eating;
[*] fixed icons in the Talent Tree;
[*] fixed active skills visual bugs;
[*] accelerated explosion triggering for the "Hand of the Abyss" skill, fixed flight of the sphere, the skill can be used while jumping and falling;
[*] cast animation for the "Lightning Shield" skill was accelerated;
[*] cast animation for the skill "Swarm" was accelerated;
[*] cast animation for the skill "Shadow of Death" was accelerated, as well as disappearance of the summoned Samnymmat (Spearman), fixed visualisation of the appearance of the Sammnymat;
[*] animation of the explosion for the skill "Stone Skin" was accelerated, improved general visualization of the effect;
[*] added animation of activating for "Poison Blade" skill;
[*] fixed balance of health and damage of the enemies;
[*] fixed balance;
[*] fixed shards drop balance;
[*] fixed talent prices in the Talents Tree;
[*] the "Autolooting" talent was moved lower in the Talents Tree, the price was changed;
[*] fixed visual bug of the stun overlay icon.
[/list]

Fixed the following critical bugs: 
[list]
[*] Unable to exit Arenas (trap rooms); 
[*] Unable to exit the Altar window; 
[*] Player speed changes after leveling up.
[/list]
